00:58:27.610 --> 00:58:36.800
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by Mr. Torey Malatia. Whenever I go up to him to talk about the budget or advertising or marketing for the radio show, he responds by saying,
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监管由托瑞·马拉蒂亚先生负责。每当我去找他谈预算、广告或广播节目的营销时，他都会回答说：

00:58:36.800 --> 00:58:41.060
<v Julia Pimsleur>I don't know. I have to go look it up in The Lesbian Love Handbook of Life.
<v Julia Pimsleur>我不知道。我得去《女同性恋爱情生活手册》里查查。

00:58:41.060 --> 00:58:55.030
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:55.030 --> 00:59:00.030
